  "articleBody": "It's easy to get excited about the idea of a tiny home, but sometimes the floor plan doesn't quite match how you actually live. If you find yourself constantly bumping into things, struggling to find storage, or wishing you had a different setup for daily tasks, your layout might be limiting your lifestyle. Often, this happens when a tiny home is built without a deep dive into the homeowner's specific needs and routines. Maybe your kitchen isn't efficient for your cooking style, or your living area doesn't comfortably accommodate guests. Zen Tiny Homes takes a unique approach; we don't just scale down standard plans. We design every square foot around *your* specific needs—how you'll cook, sleep, work, store belongings, and relax. We believe your home should support your life, not force you to adapt to it. Our process involves one-on-one custom floor-plan development, ensuring that from property assessment through design, your home reflects your lifestyle, priorities, and budget. If your current layout isn't working, or you're planning a new build and want to ensure it truly fits you, reaching out to specialists who prioritize custom, livability-focused design is a smart move. Let's make sure your tiny home elevates your lifestyle.",
